                                                "sense_id": "f85a7163-5c6e-3bdb-afaf-9bac2c1c6bc1",
                                                "text": "To Westminster Hall in the morning with Captain Lambert, and there he did at the Dog give me and some other friends of his, his foy, he being to set sail to-day towards the Streights."
